How to Download image annotator

link: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BupyYUw2boI

1. download anconda to computer
2. open cmd and check if there is conda in PC
	>> conda --version
3. Download image annotator
	>> conda create -n image-annotator python=3.10
	>> activate image-annotator
		This will change the base
	>> pip install digitalsreeni-image-annotator
4. Open the image annotator
	>> sreeni
	I Got error after this: ImportError: cannot import name 'imsave' from 'tifffile' - so we need to downgrade tifffile
	>> pip install "tifffile<2023.7.4"
	>> sreeni
		will open the sreeni